[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3088\u3057\u3001\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u306E\u6E96\u5099\u3082\u9806\u8ABF\uFF01\n\u6B21\u306F\u3042\u305D\u3053\u306E\u304A\u5E97\u3067\u3001\u3042\u306E\u7D20\u6750\u3092\u8CB7\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, the present preparations are coming along nicely!\nNext, I\u0027ll head to that shop to buy those materials..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2015\u2015\u3048\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u305D\u308C\u672C\u5F53\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "--What!? Is that true!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u901A\u884C\u4EBAA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\uFF1F\u3000\u4F55\u304B\u3042\u3063\u305F\u306E\u304B\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Hm? What\u0027s going on?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u306E\u30E6\u30CA\u304C\u3001\n\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u8A18\u5FF5\u5927\u4F1A\u306B\u51FA\u5834\u3059\u308B\u3089\u3057\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I heard Juna of the Midnight Sun Knights is going to compete in the Star Festival Championship!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u901A\u884C\u4EBAB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3048\u3063\uFF01\uFF1F\u3000\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u304C\uFF01\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(What!? Juna is!?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u771F\u76F8\u3092\u78BA\u304B\u3081\u308B\u3079\u304F\u3001\u79C1\u306F\u96EA\u5C71\u306E\u5965\u5730\u3078\u3068\u5411\u304B\u3063\u305F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And so, to find out the truth, I headed deep into the snowy mountains..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u30FC\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u3053\u3053\u306B\u3044\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF01\n\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u8A18\u5FF5\u5927\u4F1A\u306B\u51FA\u5834\u3059\u308B\u3063\u3066\u3001\u672C\u5F53\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna! So this is where you were!\nIs it true that you\u0027re entering the Star Festival Championship!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u4F11\u6687\u4E2D\u3068\u3044\u3048\u3069\u8155\u3092\u920D\u3089\u305B\u308B\u308F\u3051\u306B\u306F\u3044\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3002\n\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u8A18\u5FF5\u5927\u4F1A\u306F\u8155\u8A66\u3057\u306B\u3061\u3087\u3046\u3069\u3044\u3044\u3068\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. Even on leave, I cannot allow my skills to dull.\nI thought the Star Festival Championship would be perfect for testing my abilities."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3042\u306E\u3001\u305D\u306E\u5927\u4F1A\u306F\u5F37\u3055\u3092\u7AF6\u3046\u3082\u306E\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... this isn\u0027t actually a competition of strength..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u306A\u306B\u3063\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u5927\u4F1A\u306F\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u306B\u3061\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3001\n\u661F\u306B\u3075\u3055\u308F\u3057\u3044\u5FC3\u306E\u7F8E\u3057\u3055\u3092\u7AF6\u3046\u5927\u4F1A\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This championship is tied to the Star Festival.\nIt\u0027s a contest to see who has the most star-worthy beautiful heart!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3063\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u51FA\u5834\u767B\u9332\u3001\u9593\u9055\u3048\u3066\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did you register for the wrong competition?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u5927\u4F1A\u3068\u3044\u3046\u304B\u3089\u3001\u6B66\u529B\u3067\u5F37\u3055\u3092\u7AF6\u3046\u3082\u306E\u3060\u3068\u2026\u2026\n\u512A\u52DD\u8CDE\u54C1\u306B\u6C17\u3092\u53D6\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u305F\u79C1\u306E\u843D\u3061\u5EA6\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. When I heard \u0027championship,\u0027 I assumed it was a test of martial prowess...\nI was too focused on the prize. This is my fault."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u512A\u52DD\u8CDE\u54C1\u306F\u2026\u2026\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3082\u306E\u2026\u2026\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The grand prize was... something cute... wasn\u0027t it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306F\u305D\u308C\u306F\u3001\u3068\u3066\u3082\u2026\u2026\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u3064\u3044\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. It was... it was... something incredibly... cute.\nThat\u0027s why I..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304C\u3001\u4ECA\u3055\u3089\u8F9E\u9000\u306A\u3069\u3068\u3044\u3046\u304B\u3063\u3053\u60AA\u3044\u771F\u4F3C\u306F\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3002\n\u51FA\u5834\u3059\u308B\u304B\u3089\u306B\u306F\u512A\u52DD\u3042\u308B\u306E\u307F\u3060\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "However, withdrawing now would be unseemly.\nIf I\u0027m participating, then victory is the only option!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304B\u3063\u3053\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u79C1\u306B\u3082\u304A\u624B\u4F1D\u3044\u3055\u305B\u3066\n\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u5927\u4F1A\u512A\u52DD\u306B\u5411\u3051\u3066\u3001\u7279\u8A13\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re so cool, Juna! Please let me help!\nLet\u0027s train together for your championship victory!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3089\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u8A18\u5FF5\u5927\u4F1A\u3067\u306F\u3001\u51FA\u3055\u308C\u305F\u304A\u984C\u306B\u5BFE\u3057\u3066\n\u7F8E\u3057\u3044\u89E3\u7B54\u304C\u3067\u304D\u305F\u3089\u3044\u3044\u3089\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It seems in the Star Festival Championship, you need to give beautiful answers to the questions they pose."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3069\u3093\u306A\u304A\u984C\u304C\u51FA\u308B\u304B\u306F\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3044\u306E\u3067\u2026\u2026\n\u307E\u305A\u306F\u5F62\u304B\u3089\u5165\u308A\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But since we don\u0027t know what questions they\u0027ll ask...\nlet\u0027s start with the basics!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F62\u2026\u2026\u898B\u305F\u76EE\u306E\u7F8E\u3057\u3055\u3001\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Basics... you mean physical beauty?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\uFF01\u3000\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u601D\u3046\u7F8E\u3057\u3055\u3092\u3001\n\u8EAB\u4F53\u3067\u8868\u73FE\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Let\u0027s express your idea of beauty through movement...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3080\u2026\u2026\u3053\u3046\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u304A\u3001\u7F8E\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! That\u0027s beautiful, Juna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u3069\u3046\u3060\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How about this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3049\u30FC\uFF01\u3000\u6700\u9AD8\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh! That\u0027s perfect!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u6B21\u306F\u3001\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna, now try this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3053\u3046\u3001\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3042\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01\u3000\u512A\u52DD\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow! Juna, you\u0027re so cute! That\u0027s championship material!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304B\u3001\u304B\u3089\u304B\u3046\u306A\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "D-Don\u0027t tease me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u666E\u6BB5\u306E\u935B\u932C\u3088\u308A\u3001\u75B2\u308C\u305F\u6C17\u304C\u3059\u308B\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This feels more exhausting than my usual training..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u3055\u3059\u304C\u306E\u8EAB\u306E\u3053\u306A\u3057\u3067\u3057\u305F\uFF01\n\u3053\u308C\u306A\u3089\u3070\u512A\u52DD\u9593\u9055\u3044\u306A\u3057\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna, your movements were amazing!\nWith this, victory is assured!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3002\u79C1\u3082\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3068\u306E\u7279\u8A13\u306E\u304A\u304B\u3052\u304B\u3001\n\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u512A\u52DD\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\u6C17\u304C\u3057\u3066\u304D\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, Resna. Perhaps thanks to our training together,\nI\u0027m starting to feel like I really could win."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5927\u4F1A\u5F53\u65E5\u306F\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u52A9\u624B\u3068\u3057\u3066\u79C1\u3082\u51FA\u5834\u3057\u307E\u3059\uFF01\n\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3089\u3001\u4E8C\u4EBA\u4E00\u7D44\u306E\u51FA\u5834\u3092\u63A8\u5968\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3057",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "On the day of the championship, I\u0027ll enter as your assistant!\nThey seem to be encouraging pairs to participate together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
